00:33:15,386 --> 00:33:34,030
但是——关键在于——在域上一元多项式环中，我们熟知 $F[x]$ 的所有理想： 我们对它们的刻画，就像我们刻画整数环的所有理想一样！
But—and this is the key— in this ring, polynomials over a field, we know all ideals in $F[x]$:   we determined them just like we determined all the ideals of the integers!

