149
00:34:32,490 --> 00:34:47,905
对吧？我的意思是，这正是说作为该理想中元素的 $f(x)$ 必须是 $g(x)$ 的倍式，这恰恰就是整除条件——该理想中的元素全都是 $g(x)$ 的倍式。
Right? I mean, this just says that $f(x)$, which is a particular element in this ideal, has to be a multiple of $g(x)$, which is just the divisibility condition—the elements in this ideal are just multiples of $g(x)$.

150
00:34:47,905 --> 00:35:06,117
因此，我们能找到一个包含 $(f(x))$ 的理想，恰好对应于找到一个整除 $f(x)$ 的首一多项式。 现在如果 $f$ 不可约，那么整除 $f(x)$ 的首一多项式只能是 $f(x)$与 $1$。
So therefore we're going to get an ideal containing $(f(x))$ precisely when we can find a monic polynomial that divides $f(x)$.   Now if $f$ is irreducible, the only monic polynomials that divide $f(x)$ are $f(x)$ and $1$.

151
00:35:06,117 --> 00:35:14,004
如果有任何次数更低的多项式整除它，它就不是不可约的了！
If there were any polynomial of smaller degree that divided it, it wouldn't be irreducible!

152
00:35:14,004 --> 00:35:20,310
如果这个因式是 $f(x)$，你得到的就是原来的理想；如果这个因式是 $1$，你得到的就是整个全环。因此只有这两个理想！
If this polynomial is $f(x)$, you get this ideal; if this polynomial is $1$, you get the whole ring. And you get only those two ideals!

153
00:35:20,310 --> 00:35:39,195
反之，如果商环是一个域，那么夹在两者之间的任何理想都必须要么是自身要么是全环， 这说明在此情形下 $g(x)$ 必然等于 $f(x)$（若同次数的首一多项式整除 $f(x)$，它必等于 $f(x)$）；
Conversely, if this is a field, then any ideal squeezed between here and here has to either be this or that,   which says in this case that $g(x)$ is equal to $f(x)$ (if a monic polynomial of the same degree divides $f(x)$, it has to be equal to $f(x)$);   and in the other case,

154
00:35:39,195 --> 00:35:54,057
而在另一种情形下，则说明 $g(x)$是首一多项式 $1$，从而不存在任何非平凡因式。清楚了吗？因此，通过这种扩域构造得到域的充要准则，就是你必须采用不可约多项式。
it would say $g(x)$ was the monic polynomial $1$, and so there were no non-trivial factors. Okay? So the criterion for this extension process to give you a field is that you have to work with an irreducible polynomial.

