157
00:36:28,510 --> 00:37:00,685
—我们就需要在 $p$ 元域上找到一个不可约二次多项式 $x^2 - c$。其实，它不一定非要是这种形式，它可以是——抱歉——$p$ 元域上的任意 $x^2 + bx + c$。
we need an irreducible quadratic polynomial $x^2 - c$ over the field of $p$ elements. Well, actually, it doesn't have to look like this, it could be—sorry—$x^2 + bx + c$ over the field of $p$ elements.

158
00:37:00,685 --> 00:37:14,058
如果我们能找到这样一个不可约二次多项式，那么通过这个构造我们就能得到一个 $p^2$ 元的有限域。 如果不存在这样的不可约二次多项式，这个构造就行不通。
If we can find such an irreducible quadratic polynomial, then by doing this construction we would get a field of $p^2$ elements.   If there is no such irreducible quadratic polynomial, this construction isn't going to work.

